  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yes I Do - Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adolescents and youth (10-24)</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of YID programme is for adolescent girls to decide if, when and whom to marry and if, when and with whom to have children with, and are protected from FGM/C. The alliance uses multiple strategies to reach this desired impact, namely: social mobilization, meaningful engagement and empowerment of young people; improved SRH information and services; improved access to education and economic opportunities and dialogues</narrative>
  </description>
